{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32253","headline":"经李徵君故居 · 温庭筠","name":"经李徵君故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露浓烟重草萋萋，树映阑干柳拂堤。\n一院落花无客醉，五更残月有莺啼。\n芳筵想像情难尽，故榭荒凉路已迷。\n惆怅羸骖往来惯，每经门巷亦长嘶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}